# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache

# ── Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

# ── Modernizer working folder ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The migration plan and everything the run produced: route-map, service-map,
# dto-map, schema.json, db-schema.txt, the enrichment transcripts and the copy of
# the legacy source it read. Regenerated by every Phase A run and often large, so
# it is an output rather than a source — the .sql files it was derived FROM are
# what belong in version control.
.modernizer/

# ── Local database ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite files are created on first run: EnsureCreated builds the schema, then
# seed-data.sql and demo-data.sql fill it. Committing one would freeze somebody
# else's local edits into the repository, and deleting it is the supported reset.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ── Large local artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.mp4

# ── Kept deliberately ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Infrastructure/Persistence/seed-data.sql   the harvested legacy seed
# Infrastructure/Persistence/demo-data.sql   demo content, hand-written
# technical-doc/                             the technical documentation
# coverage_report.html                       committed on purpose
